<title>POLAND: POLISH BUDGET DEFICIT AT PLN 234 MLN IN JANUARY.</title>
<headline>POLISH BUDGET DEFICIT AT PLN 234 MLN IN JANUARY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish budget deficit amounted to</p>
<p>234 million zlotys in January, which accounted for 1.9 percent</p>
<p>of the planned 1997 deficit of 12.220 billion zlotys, the</p>
<p>finance ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p> POLISH BUDGET GAP	   January	1997 plan</p>
<p>  balance in bln PLN	  0.23	    12.220</p>
<p>  revenue			 8.10	   115.334</p>
<p>  expenditure		   8.33	   127.554</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
